{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38108","headline":"南亭 · 韩偓","name":"南亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"每日在南亭，南亭似僧院。\n人语静先闻，鸟啼深不见。\n松瘦石棱棱，山光溪淀淀。\n堑蔓坠长茸，岛花垂小蒨。\n行簪隐士冠，卧读先贤传。\n更有兴来时，取琴弹一徧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩偓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38108.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38108","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}